  "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/242) by Paul Matthijsse (Bitbucket: [Paul Matthijsse](https://bitbucket.org/Paul Matthijsse), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nHi, it would be nice if a user can select which tools show up when F1 is pressed in the editor, as some of them I seldom use, while the ones I use most show up only partially.\n\nI’m aware that this may not be trivial, but maybe it can be done using the options file? Make a new group called \\[Shortcuts\\] with a list like Exposure=true, L\\*a\\*b=false, Sharpening=true, etc.\n",
